<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Conjurer Spells</h1>
<p>The spells the Conjurers' guild of Udgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the spell there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p>
<pre>Name                     Level   Up to
Detect Magic                 0   100%
Energy Bolt                  0   100%
Raise Magic                  0   100%
Brain                        2   100%
Magic Candle                 3   100%
Dexterity                    6   100%
Constitution                 8   100%
Leaving                      8   100%
Dust Devil                   9   100%
Detect Invisible            10   100%
Strength                    10   100%
Identify                    11   100%
Focus                       12   100%
Storm Call                  12   100%
Clenched Fist               13   100%
Lock                        14   100%
Mind Shield                 14   80%
Summon Earth                14   100%
Heat Resistance             15   80%
Quicken                     15   100%
Slow                        15   80%
Cold Resistance             16   80%
Electricity Resistance      17   80%
Transport                   17   100%
Night Globe                 18   100%
Poison Resistance           18   80%
Summon Air                  18   100%
Sun Globe                   18   100%
Acid Resistance             19   80%
Invisibility                20   100%
Improved Identify           21   100%
Random Teleport             22   100%
Wizard Eye                  23   100%
Summon Water                24   100%
Minor Gate                  27   100%
